        "acc-2": {
          "type": "acc",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Free shipping",
            "use_desc": false,
            "text": "<p>We’re offering free shipping within Canada for all orders.</p><p>We ship our packages with a Track &amp; Trace code so you can always monitor your order.</p><p>You will receive the Track &amp; Trace code via email within 24-72 hours after placing your order.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "acc-3": {
          "type": "acc",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Customer service",
            "use_desc": false,
            "text": "<p>Our customer service team is here to answer all your questions and comments. Whether you need advice on a product or help with an order, we are here to support you.</p><p>Don’t hesitate to contact us; we’re happy to help!</p><p>Please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@daltonpierce.com\">support@daltonpierce.com</a>. We aim to respond within 1 business day.</p><p>Customer service hours: Monday–Friday, 9:00 AM–6:00 PM ET; Saturday–Sunday, 10:00 AM–4:00 PM ET.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "acc-4": {
          "type": "acc",
          "settings": {
            "title": "14-day money-back guarantee",
            "use_desc": false,
            "text": "<p>If our product does not meet your expectations, you can return it within 14 days upon receipt.<\/p><p>Before returning the goods, please contact our customer service at <a href=\"mailto:support@daltonpierce.com\">support@daltonpierce.com<\/a> and let us know the reason for the return so we can process your request correctly.<\/p><p>Please review our <a href=\"\/pages\/return-and-refund-policy\">return policy<\/a> for more information!<\/p>",
            "open": false,
            "only_types": "",
            "except_types": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-5": {
          "type": "acc",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Care",
            "use_desc": false,
            "text": "<p>With just a little care, your knitwear will stay beautiful for years to come. We recommend professional dry cleaning to preserve its softness and shape.<\/p><p>For a deeper clean, gently handwash in cool water up to 30°C with a wool-safe detergent, then lay flat to dry. Always follow the care label in the garment – it takes priority over any general advice.<\/p>",
            "open": false,
            "only_types": "Sweaters,Cardigans",
            "except_types": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-6": {
          "type": "acc",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Care",
            "use_desc": false,
            "text": "<p>Follow the care label in the garment – it takes priority over any general advice.<\/p><p>As a rule of thumb: wash at 30°C on a gentle cycle, turn prints and dark colours inside out, skip the dryer and dry flat rather than on a hanger.<\/p>",
            "open": false,
            "only_types": "",
            "except_types": "Sweaters,Cardigans,Sneakers,Loafers,Boots,Dress Shoes,Sandals,Heels,Slides,Mules,Clogs,Espadrilles,Sunglasses,Jewelry,Bags,Belts,Underwear"
          }
        }
      },
